@startuml
' Readability layout by Vincent with Codex assistance (#393); existing model/feature credit retained.
!include style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR

    class PonHubDataState

    class Student
    class Tutor

    class Lesson

PonHubDataState "0..*" --> "0..*" Lesson : ordered catalogue
Lesson "0..*" --> "1" Tutor : tutorId (PersonId)
Lesson "0..*" -- "0..*" Student : enrolledStudentIds (PersonId)

note on link
  Each Lesson alone stores its roster
  of stable Student IDs.
  Student records do not contain
  copied lesson membership.
end note

@enduml
